  %% Entry
  A([Signal received]) --> B{Signal type}

  %% Signal types
  B -->|IOC intel| C[Normalize signal\nExtract indicator type source confidence]
  B -->|SIEM alert| D[Normalize signal\nParse rule entities severity time window]
  B -->|EDR detection| E[Normalize signal\nParse host user process hash network]
  B -->|Vulnerability CVE| F[Normalize signal\nParse CVE assets exposure criticality]
  B -->|User report| G[Normalize signal\nParse narrative entities time window]
  B -->|Other| H[Normalize signal\nBest effort entity extraction]

  %% Case creation or linkage
  C --> I[Create or link SOAR case\nAssign case ID evidence container]
  D --> I
  E --> I
  F --> I
  G --> I
  H --> I

  %% SOAR context
  I --> J{SOAR context available}
  J -->|Yes| J1[Pull SOAR context\nPrior notes actions owners tags artifacts]
  J -->|No| J2[Create minimal case context\nNew case empty history]

  %% Query planning
  J1 --> K[Build query plan\nTools time window entities pivots]
  J2 --> K

  %% Detection pulls
  K --> L[Pull detections via adapters\nSIEM EDR email DNS proxy cloud]
  L --> M{Detections found}

  M -->|Yes| M1[Summarize detections\nCounts assets users hosts timeline]
  M -->|No| M2[Record no detections\nAdjust confidence broaden pivots]

  %% Enrichment
  M1 --> N[Enrich indicators and entities\nReputation WHOIS geo malware TTP links]
  M2 --> N
  N --> O{Enrichment available}

  O -->|Good| O1[Attach enrichment results\nLabel sources confidence]
  O -->|Limited or none| O2[Mark enrichment gaps\nNote missing sources limits]

  %% Correlation
  O1 --> P[Correlate signals\nLink indicator alerts assets users hosts]
  O2 --> P
  P --> Q{Correlations found}

  Q -->|Strong| Q1[Build incident view\nTimeline hypotheses killchain]
  Q -->|Weak or none| Q2[Standalone signal view\nLower confidence widen search]

  %% Similar cases
  Q1 --> R[Find similar cases\nBy entities TTP alert family outcome]
  Q2 --> R
  R --> S{Similar cases found}

  S -->|Yes| S1[Extract patterns and proven actions\nWhat closed it last time]
  S -->|No| S2[Use baseline templates\nActions by signal type and severity]

  %% Trend and ETS
  S1 --> T[Trend and forecast\nETS multi horizon on key entities]
  S2 --> T
  T --> U{Sufficient history for ETS}

  U -->|Yes| U1[Compute baseline spike anomaly score\nInclude backtest summary]
  U -->|No| U2[Skip forecast\nState insufficient history proceed]

  %% Disposition
  U1 --> V{Disposition}
  U2 --> V

  V -->|True positive| V1[Generate TP action proposals\nContainment eradication escalation comms]
  V -->|False positive| V2[Generate FP closure and tuning\nSuppress allowlist rule fix]
  V -->|Benign informational| V3[Generate benign notes\nDocument and close guidance]
  V -->|Needs review| V4[Generate review plan\nGaps questions next pivots]

  %% Always render deterministic packet
  V1 --> W([Render deterministic triage packet TP\nDecision evidence actions metrics])
  V2 --> X([Render deterministic triage packet FP\nDecision rationale tuning metrics])
  V3 --> Y([Render deterministic triage packet Benign\nDecision rationale metrics])
  V4 --> Z([Render deterministic triage packet Needs Review\nGaps questions next steps])

  %% AI overlay (optional, bounded to evidence)
  W --> AO{AI overlay enabled}
  X --> AO
  Y --> AO
  Z --> AO

  AO -->|No| P0[Use deterministic packet]
  AO -->|Yes| AI[AI overlay\nSummarize rewrite clarify\nBounded to evidence no new facts]
  AI --> P0

  %% Automation governance (auto-close or auto-escalate)
  P0 --> AG{Automation governance applies}
