  AG -->|Yes| AC{Meets auto close criteria}
  AC -->|Yes| CLOSE[Auto close case\nAdd closure reason\nTag outcome FP or Benign]
  CLOSE --> CATT[Attach packet plus closure receipt\nUpdate notes tags metrics]
